              <img src="assets/nuclear_bomb_wrap.png" alt="Paneer Butter Masala Wrap">
              <span class="card-tag veg">Veg</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-details">
              <h3>PANEER BUTTER MASALA WRAP</h3>
