  <!-- ------------------------------------------------------------------------
       FAQ Section
       ------------------------------------------------------------------------ -->
  <section class="faq" id="faq">
    <div class="reviews-header reveal">
      <span class="section-tag">Clear Doubts</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>Everything you need to know about ordering, delivery, location, and vegetarian items.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="faq-container reveal">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <h3>Do you offer delivery?</h3>
          <div class="faq-toggle"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, absolutely! We offer online ordering directly through our website, and we are also available on Zomato and Swiggy for quick, no-contact home delivery in and around Punjagutta.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <h3>Is dine-in available?</h3>
          <div class="faq-toggle"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! We are located in the premium food court on Floor 5 of the Next Galleria Mall. There is a massive, clean, air-conditioned seating area where you can sit and enjoy your hot spicy food.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <h3>Are vegetarian options available?</h3>
          <div class="faq-toggle"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, we love our vegetarian foodies! We have outstanding options like the Indian Fries Wrap, Creamy Paneer Tikka Wraps, crispy Cheese Cigars, and a collection of delicious cakes/desserts.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <h3>What are your most popular wraps?</h3>
          <div class="faq-toggle"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Our absolute number one bestseller is the Nuclear Bomb Chicken Wrap. If you prefer something extra cheesy, the Chill Cheese Chicken Pocket is highly recommended.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <h3>Is mall parking available?</h3>
          <div class="faq-toggle"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, Next Galleria Mall has safe, multi-level underground parking for both two-wheelers and four-wheelers. Alternatively, you can take the Hyderabad Metro directly to Punjagutta, as the station connects right into the mall.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

